# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and set the Founder's handle.
# The conserved core — changes require the Founder's review.

# Constitution and standing rules
/ORG.md            @founder-handle
/AUTHORITY.md      @founder-handle
/EXECUTION.md      @founder-handle
/AUTHORING.md      @founder-handle
/MOUNTING.md       @founder-handle
/voice.md          @founder-handle

# Active Processes, doctrines and Role charters
/processes/        @founder-handle
/roles/            @founder-handle

# Rulings. A Decision file asserts that the Founder said something —
# forging one is the failure this line exists to prevent.
/decisions/        @founder-handle

/CODEOWNERS        @founder-handle
/.github/CODEOWNERS @founder-handle

# Drafts are deliberately NOT conserved: a draft grants no reusable Authority,
# and requiring review to write one would defeat its purpose. Listing the path
# last with no owner clears the inherited /processes/ ownership.
/processes/draft/
